tle=\"Broad category of document (e.g. 11502-2 Laboratory report).\">documentCategory</a><a name=\"EHDSDocumentSearchMetadata.documentCategory\"> </a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">1..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/datatypes.html#CodeableConcept\">CodeableConcept</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">Broad category of document (e.g. 11502-2 Laboratory report).<br class=\"binding\"/><span class=\"xhtPieceBold binding\">Binding Description: </span><span class=\"binding\"> (</span><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/terminologies.html#required\" title=\"To be conformant, the concept in this element SHALL be from the specified value set.\" class=\"binding\">required</a><span class=\"binding\">)</span><span class=\"binding\"> </span><span title=\"This binding doesn't define a testable ValueSet\" class=\"xhtBindingNotTestable xhtPieceBold binding\">⚠</span><span class=\"binding\">: </span><span class=\"binding\">LOINC</span></td></tr>\r\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck10.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_datatype.gif\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Data Type\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">EHDSDocumentSearchMetadata.</span><a href=\"StructureDefinition-EHDSDocumentSearchMetadata-definitions.html#EHDSDocumentSearchMetadata.documentType\" title=\"Type of document (e.g. 18725-2 Microbiology studies (set)).\">documentType</a><a name=\"EHDSDocumentSearchMetadata.documentType\"> </a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">1..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/datatypes.html#CodeableConcept\">CodeableConcept</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">Type of document (e.g. 18725-2 Microbiology studies (set)).<br class=\"binding\"/><span class=\"xhtPieceBold binding\">Binding Description: </span><span class=\"binding\"> (</span><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/terminologies.html#required\" title=\"To be conformant, the concept in this element SHALL be from the specified value set.\" class=\"binding\">required</a><span class=\"binding\">)</span><span class=\"binding\"> </span><span title=\"This binding doesn't define a testable ValueSet\" class=\"xhtBindingNotTestable xhtPieceBold binding\">⚠</span><span class=\"binding\">: </span><span class=\"binding\">LOINC</span></td></tr>\r\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck10.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_primitive.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Primitive Data Type\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">EHDSDocumentSearchMetadata.</span><a href=\"StructureDefinition-EHDSDocumentSearchMetadata-definitions.html#EHDSDocumentSearchMetadata.documentTitle\" title=\"Human-readable document title that may be displayed in search results etc. This may be documentType’s display name, or it may be assembled from multiple elements. Examples: ‘Laboratory result report’, ‘Patient summary of Jane Green 10.12.2024’.\">documentTitle</a><a name=\"EHDSDocumentSearchMetadata.documentTitle\"> </a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">1..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/datatypes.html#string\">string</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">Human-readable document title that may be displayed in search results etc. This may be documentType’s display name, or it may be assembled from multiple elements. Examples: ‘Laboratory result report’, ‘Patient summary of Jane Green 10.12.2024’.</td></tr>\r\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck10.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_datatype.gif\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Data Type\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">EHDSDocumentSearchMetadata.</span><a href=\"StructureDefinition-EHDSDocumentSearchMetadata-definitions.html#EHDSDocumentSearchMetadata.period\" title=\"Time of service that is being documented.\">period</a><a name=\"EHDSDocumentSearchMetadata.period\"> </a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">0..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/datatypes.html#Period\">Period</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">Time of service that is being documented.</td></tr>\r\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck11.png)\"