lt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Choice of Types\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">EHDSDocumentSearchMetadata.legalAuthentication.</span><a href=\"StructureDefinition-EHDSDocumentSearchMetadata-definitions.html#EHDSDocumentSearchMetadata.legalAuthentication.legalAuthenticator[x]\" title=\"The person taking responsibility for the medical content of the document. legalAuthenticator may be different from author and attester (e.g author=junior doctor, attester=senior physician, legalAuthenticator= attending physician).\">legalAuthenticator[x]</a><a name=\"EHDSDocumentSearchMetadata.legalAuthentication.legalAuthenticator_x_\"> </a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">1..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">The person taking responsibility for the medical content of the document. legalAuthenticator may be different from author and attester (e.g author=junior doctor, attester=senior physician, legalAuthenticator= attending physician).</td></tr>\r\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck1110.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_datatype.gif\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Data Type\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; wi